TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="tests/**, src/**"

TEST_COMMAND:
- cargo test
- cargo test -- --nocapture (for output during debugging)
- cargo test --release (for performance-sensitive tests)

TEST_CONVENTIONS:
- Unit tests in #[cfg(test)] mod tests block inside the module under test
- Integration tests in tests/ directory (separate compilation unit)
- Test function names: snake_case describing the behavior: test_returns_err_on_empty_input
- Use #[should_panic(expected = "...")] for panic tests

COVERAGE_REQUIREMENTS:
- (fill in — e.g., "no hard threshold; tarpaulin for coverage reports in CI")

FORBIDDEN_IN_TESTS:
- No real network calls — use mock servers (wiremock, httpmock)
- No real filesystem writes except via tempfile crate
- No #[ignore] without a comment and tracking issue
